.TH CHTTPCLIENT_ASYNC_RESULT_GET 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
chttpclient_async_result_get \- block until an async request's future is fulfilled and return its typed result
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <chttpclient.h>

chttpcli_async_result_t *chttpclient_async_result_get(ctpool_future *f);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
A thin wrapper over ctpool_future_get that casts its void* result to
chttpcli_async_result_t*.  Safe to call more than once on the same
future (matching ctpool_future_get's own contract); every call
after the first returns the same result pointer, still owned by the
future until freed.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
f Future returned by chttpclient_do_async or
  chttpclient_do_async_streaming.
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
The result, or NULL if f is NULL or the future was cancelled before
being fulfilled.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpclient_do_async (3),
.BR chttpclient_do_async_streaming (3),
.BR chttpclient_async_result_free (3),
.BR ctpool_future_get (3)
